c's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"pXgwHjFaoj1DQhDCpWmTxg","review_id":"VyFFTDaLnp0OhJJ5d_Qz2Q","date":"2019-11-23T19:58:10","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9544094800949097,"text_excerpt":"Wow. I mean just wow. The space is so nice!! Here and Zony Mash have turned up the opening sequence up to 11. All Relation came swinging out of the corner with 12 on tap. Wow. Really good brews too! Granted you need to be a IPA aficionado but not really. There is some good gateway IPAs. My fav to get that PBR friend to try a IPA is \"Flossed on Paradise\". Yummy! More is better and this new brewery is a great example of the evolution of breweries in Nola. There is a lot of thought put into this location and it shows. The cozy library feel, similar to Bakery Bar. Large outdoor seating area for the smokers and fresh air folks. Indoors is so nice. Really cool booths. Intimate for sure. The way..."},{"business_id":"pXgwHjFaoj1DQhDCpWmTxg","review_id":"4RaeZ0c7lXNNODxMh5WPzw","date":"2020-02-13T05:12:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9402318596839905,"text_excerpt":"Awesome place can't get enough of the cool black cans and nice bathrooms. The beer is solid and I plan on making this my spot when we come back into town. The vibe is super chill and the staff is awesome. Chill vibe for a low key night from it all."},{"business_id":"pXgwHjFaoj1DQhDCpWmTxg","review_id":"s6fUcqzQxvHkjEjJlZtRwQ","date":"2019-11-23T23:09:56","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9355971813201904,"text_excerpt":"Nice new brewery, interesting design elements inside feel like you've been transported to Brooklyn or other hipster haven. Nice selection of beers for the first day. The Cheve Mexican lager is malty and clean, the flossed on paradise is a sweet piña colada berliner, and the bird sauce is a hazy IPA that competes with the city's best. I'm looking forward to returning soon!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
